      "respond": {
        "type": "text",
        "value": "The party reaches the end of the causeway as the light goes amber, on the trail of whoever silenced the ferry bell. Tamsin Vale, Brother Odo and Kestrel mean to have the ferry crossing again before full dark. Wenna Marsh keeps close with her boathook, and smoke from the goblins' reed-camp curls up from the reeds ahead. Where do you start?"
      }
    },
